# ⚖️ Service Comparison

| Service           | Type                    | Server Management     | Containers    | Best For                           |
| ----------------- | ----------------------- | --------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| EC2               | Virtual Machine         | High                  | Optional      | Maximum control                    |
| Lambda            | Serverless              | None                  | No            | Event-driven applications          |
| Fargate           | Serverless Containers   | None                  | Yes           | Running containers without servers |
| Elastic Beanstalk | PaaS                    | Low                   | Optional      | Simple application deployment      |
| ECS               | Container Orchestration | Depends               | Yes           | AWS-native containers              |
| EKS               | Kubernetes              | Control plane managed | Yes           | Kubernetes workloads               |
| ECR               | Container Registry      | None                  | Stores images | Container image storage            |

